  "customNotes": [
    {
      "timestamp": 1780196484728,
      "topic": "SafeNN proposed all-pass priority order",
      "details": [
        "1) Remove case-specific logic; keep one unified algorithmic pipeline.",
        "2) Tune parameters only from physical/numerical properties (grid size, Re, stiffness, boundary type), not by case ID.",
        "3) Improve stiff cases first (cavity Re=400/1000, T-junction, backward step, cylinder wake, multi-cylinder) with generic stabilization and safer final-state selection.",
        "4) Keep 1x/2x/3x physics-consistent scaling and regenerate initial/boundary conditions consistently across levels.",
        "5) Preserve paper-grade verification: strict reference sources, raw histories, and no cheating via analytic injection or target-deflated solutions."
      ]
    }
  ],
